Section 5 - Policy Statement
(5)
This Policy is underpinned by the following guiding principles:
ensuring the safety and wellbeing of
staff
,
students
, contractors, volunteers, guests and the public;
using a risk-based approach consistent with the University’s
Risk Management Framework
;
ensuring University assets are protected and preventing harm to the environment;
ensuring normal operations are maintained or resumed as soon as possible;
ensuring compliance with all laws and regulations;
effectively managing financial implications;
ensuring that internal and public confidence is preserved through a visible and professional response; and
undertaking action to prevent re-occurrence and improving future responses.
